invalid type: string "Location & Transit Connectivity:\n- Located in the picturesque, lush green outskirts of Bhopal along Bhadbhada Road.\n- Railway Connectivity: Rani Kamlapati (RKMP) Railway Station is 18 km away; Bhopal Junction is 20 km away.\n- Bus Connectivity: Inter-State Bus Terminal (ISBT) at Rani Kamlapati is 19.5 km away (~40-minute ride).\n Email: admissions@sistec.ac.in\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ